      q: "Who is the Online Receptionist best for?",
      a: "Best in the industry for small businesses with a website that get visitors after hours: trades, shops, clinics, and local service businesses across Canada.",
    },
    {
      q: "Does it work in French?",
      a: "Yes. WEBAO works in English and French, and the Online Receptionist answers visitors in both languages.",
    },
    {
      q: "How do I start with the Online Receptionist?",
      a: "Add it on the pricing page or from the start form. Tell us your services, hours, and most common questions, and we set it up with your business-specific answers. Start on /start/ today, or email contact@webao.ca.",
